    "collapsible-content": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible-row-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Features:",
            "icon": "lightning_bolt",
            "row_content": "<p>✔ 45,000Hz ultrasonic cleaning gently lifts surface buildup<br\/><br\/>✔ Built-in safety sensor switches off after 20 min continuous use, cools for 20 min before reuse<br\/><br\/>✔ Built-in overheat sensor shuts off the device automatically at 55°C.<br\/><br\/>✔ Fast automatic cleaning cycle for daily use<br\/><br\/>✔ Two cleaning modes for delicate and durable items<br\/><br\/>✔ Non-abrasive cleaning with no brushing required<br\/><br\/>✔ Quiet operation for comfortable everyday use<br\/><br\/>✔ Stainless steel inner tank for durability<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "4e1e68e5-34de-4433-a8e4-3c411e567aaf": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Benefits",
            "icon": "heart",
            "row_content": "<p>✔ Keeps dental appliances looking fresh and clean<br\/><br\/>✔ Helps reduce surface stains and unwanted odours<br\/><br\/>✔ Saves time with quick, automated cleaning<br\/><br\/>✔ Gentle enough for regular use when used correctly<br\/><br\/>✔ Easy to use at home or while travelling<br\/><br\/>✔ Reduces the need for manual scrubbing<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "dc156c5a-46c9-43e5-acbd-475340353fc0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Cleaning Modes",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Short Clean Cycle (5 minutes)<br\/><\/strong>For retainers, aligners, mouth guards, and other delicate items.<\/p><p><strong>Long Clean Cycle (10 minutes)<br\/><\/strong>For durable items such as metal jewellery or keys. Not suitable for plastics or heat-sensitive items.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_parrCK": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to Use?",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>1. Fill the tank with clean, room-temperature water and add a cleaning tablet<\/p><p>2. Place the item in the basket and close the lid<\/p><p>3. Press the power button once for the 5-minute cycle, or press and hold for the 10-minute cycle<\/p><p>4. When the cycle ends, remove the item, rinse with water, and dry the tank<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What’s Included?",
            "icon": "box",
            "row_content": "<ul><li>1x Ultrasonic Cleaning Pod<br\/><\/li><li>1x Cleaning Basket<br\/><\/li><li>6x Cleaning Tablets<br\/><\/li><li>1X 24W Power Adapter with Pin charger<br\/><\/li><li>1x User Manual<\/li><\/ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_gqhDxb": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Specification",
            "icon": "chat_bubble",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Ultrasonic Frequency:<\/strong> 45,000Hz<\/p><p><strong>Power:<\/strong> 24W<\/p><p><strong>Capacity: <\/strong>200mL<\/p><p><strong>Cleaning Time:<\/strong> 5 to 10 minutes depending upon your appliance<\/p><p><strong>Tank Size: <\/strong>78 × 78 × 40 mm<\/p><p><strong>Product Size:<\/strong> 107 × 107 × 94.5 mm<\/p><p><strong>Rated Voltage:<\/strong> 12V \/ 2A<\/p><p><strong>Charging \/ Power Input:<\/strong> DC Power Adapter with Pin charger<\/p><p><strong>Materials:<\/strong> Stainless steel tank with ABS outer body<br\/><br\/><\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "2eef6090-250f-48ad-a4ec-4aacca83c975": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Care Instructions",
            "icon": "clipboard",
            "row_content": "<p>✓ Use room temperature water only<br\/><br\/>✓ Check the user manual to select the appropriate cleaning time for your item.<br\/><br\/>✓ If the device overheats, it will automatically shut off and remain inactive for approximately 30 minutes before it can be used again<br\/><br\/>✓ Do not use hot or corrosive liquids<br\/><br\/>✓ Avoid using on heat-sensitive or glued items<br\/><br\/>✓ Avoid water near the charging socket<br\/><br\/>✓ Empty and dry the tank after each use<br\/><br\/>✓ Store in a cool, dry place<br\/><br\/>✓ Keep out of reach of children and pets\\<br\/><br\/>✓ Do not open or modify the device<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "3442c9b0-dbb6-4dd7-b615-9313ba45f523": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Suitable For",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<ul><li>Retainers<\/li><li>Dentures<\/li><li>Aligners<\/li><li>Rings<\/li><li>Toothbrush Heads<\/li><li>Dental trays<\/li><li>Night\/Mouth Guards<\/li><li>Coins<\/li><li>Small Jewellery<\/li><\/ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can the Water Flosser Pro be used on composite bonding, veneers or fillings?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes, the Water Flosser Pro is suitable for use on composite bonding, veneers, and fillings. This device is designed to provide a thorough yet gentle clean, effectively removing plaque and debris from between your teeth and around dental restorations. It’s safe to use on all types of dental work, helping you maintain optimal oral hygiene without compromising the integrity of your composite bonding, veneers, or fillings.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_YAbaWX": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What can I use the Ultrasonic Cleaning Pod to clean?",
            "icon": "return",
            "row_content": "<p>The Ultrasonic Pod has been specifically designed to clean a wide range of oral appliances such as:<br\/><\/p><ul><li>Aligner\/Invisalign<\/li><li>Retainers<\/li><li>Mouth Guards<\/li><li>Dentures<\/li><li>Night Guards<\/li><li>Whitening Trays<\/li><li>Toothbrush Attachment Heads<\/li><li>Sports Guards<\/li><li>Dental Implants<\/li><\/ul><p>Not limited to dental appliances, the Pod can also be used for cleaning household items!<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
